<h3>Recent Change Summary</h3>
<p>The precision of the <code>written_premium</code> field was increased from <code>DECIMAL(18,3)</code> to <code>DECIMAL(18,6)</code> in the staging SQL SELECT statement. This change allows for higher fractional precision in the written premium amount stored in the staging view and subsequently merged into the target table.</p>

<h3>Jira Story Traceability</h3>
