<li>Create a temporary view named <code>vw_policy_xml_raw</code> from the resulting DataFrame.</li>
<li>Execute a second Spark SQL query to select account-related fields (<code>AccountNumber_newValue</code>, <code>PolicyRef_newValue</code>, <code>Producercode_newValue</code>) from the same <code>policy_xml</code> table.</li>
<li>Create a temporary view named <code>vw_account_xml_raw</code> from the second DataFrame.</li>
</ol>

